# M3.4b camera (patches 2301-2346): CSI2 PHY, the board's two SmartSens sensors
# and the CN3927 lens actuator. CAMSS and CCI are already modules in kernel 3.
# libcamera's software ISP allocates its buffers from udmabuf / the DMA-BUF
# heaps; built in as in Fedora's kernel and erhai's configuration.
CONFIG_PHY_QCOM_MIPI_CSI2=m
CONFIG_VIDEO_SC1300CS=m
CONFIG_VIDEO_SC820CS=m
CONFIG_VIDEO_CN3927=m
CONFIG_UDMABUF=y
CONFIG_DMABUF_HEAPS_SYSTEM=y
CONFIG_DMABUF_HEAPS_CMA=y
